@startuml drone-camera-rtsp-sequence
title drone-camera-rtsp: Startup & Streaming Sequence

participant "Docker Engine" as Docker
participant "entrypoint.sh" as EP
participant "mediamtx" as MTX
participant "drone_camera_streamer\n(C++ native)" as Streamer
participant "RealSense D435i\n(USB)" as Camera
participant "Standby Pattern\n(test card)" as Standby
participant "RTMP internal\n(:1935/camera)" as RTMP
participant "RTSP output\n(:8554/camera)" as RTSP
participant "Clients\n(QGC / VLC)" as Client

== Container Startup ==
Docker -> EP : start (env: RTMP_URL, STREAM_WIDTH,\nSTREAM_HEIGHT, STREAM_FPS, STREAM_BITRATE)
EP -> MTX : [1/2] /usr/local/bin/mediamtx /app/mediamtx.yml &
MTX -> RTMP : Open RTMP listener :1935
MTX -> RTSP : Open RTSP listener :8554
MTX --> EP : MEDIAMTX_PID

EP -> EP : Wait for port :1935 to be ready\n(poll ss -tln every 200ms, timeout 6s)
EP -> EP : kill -0 MEDIAMTX_PID (sanity check)

EP -> Streamer : [2/2] loop: /usr/local/bin/drone_camera_streamer /app/camera.yaml

== Steady State: Camera Available ==
Streamer -> Camera : Open RealSense D435i via pyrealsense2\n(or V4L2 fallback)
Camera --> Streamer : color frames (640x480@30fps)

Streamer -> Streamer : H.264 encode via GStreamer pipeline\n(leaky=downstream - drop old frames on overflow)
Streamer -> RTMP : Push RTMP stream to rtmp://127.0.0.1:1935/camera
MTX -> RTSP : Re-publish as rtsp://0.0.0.0:8554/camera

Client -> RTSP : RTSP PLAY request
RTSP --> Client : H.264 stream (low-latency)

== Anti-Overflow & Auto-Recovery ==
Streamer -> Streamer : Watchdog: detect pipeline stall\n(frame_count unchanged for N seconds)
Streamer -> Streamer : Re-init GStreamer pipeline\n(recovery < 1s)

== Standby Mode: Camera Not Available ==
Streamer -> Standby : Camera absent or /run/drone/camera_stats.json\nreports is_standby=true
Standby -> RTMP : Push test pattern (color bars / black frame)
MTX -> RTSP : Re-publish standby stream
note over Standby : Clients receive a live stream placeholder;\nnot a connection error.

== Camera Crash & Restart ==
Streamer -> EP : drone_camera_streamer exits (non-zero)
EP -> EP : Log error: "Streamer exited; restarting after 2s"
EP -> Streamer : sleep 2; re-exec drone_camera_streamer

== Shutdown ==
Docker -> EP : SIGTERM
EP -> Streamer : loop exits (shell trap)
EP -> MTX : kill MEDIAMTX_PID
MTX --> EP : exit
EP -> EP : exit 0


note as DeploymentContract
  Source/config: GitHub pull
  Image: GHCR linux/arm64
  Pi update: compose pull + up --no-build
  Private runtime config/state stays outside Git
end note

@enduml
